# Architecture

- Respect five layers: core, services (pages/api/factories), tests, AI ecosystem, governance.
- UI tests extend `UiBaseTest`; API tests extend `ApiBaseTest`.
- Do not create `WebDriver` / `ChromeDriver` inside tests — use `UiSessionHolder` via page objects.
- Agent-generated drafts go under `agent-generated/` only — never mix into `src/` until promotion.
- New code belongs in existing packages; do not invent parallel frameworks.
